{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26663","headline":"病中辱谏议惠甘菊药苗因以诗赠 · 姚合","name":"病中辱谏议惠甘菊药苗因以诗赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧萧一亩宫，种菊十余丛。\n采摘和芳露，封题寄病翁。\n熟宜茶鼎里，飡称石瓯中。\n香洁将何比，从来味不同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}